# Unity generated folders
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset meta data should only be ignored when the corresponding asset is also ignored
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# Uncomment this line if you wish to ignore the asset store tools plugin
# /[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# Autogenerated Jetbrains Rider plugin
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.gradle/
ExportedObj/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Unity3D generated meta files
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Unity3D generated file on crash reports
sysinfo.txt

# Builds
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# Crashlytics generated file
crashlytics-build.properties

# Packed Addressables
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Temporary auto-generated Android Assets
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Third-party art pack. Not committed: the tool is designed to be repointed at any pack
# through the catalog, and the README says no third-party assets ship with it.
/[Aa]ssets/[Mm]odels/
/[Aa]ssets/[Mm]odels.meta

# The workspace the tool builds, for the same reason and one more. Every prefab under it is a
# wrapper round a piece of the pack above — measured out of it, pointing at its GUIDs, and a
# broken reference in any clone that does not have the pack — and everything else under it is
# output: exported buildings, a synced catalog, generated starter art. Tools → ArenaForge →
# Setup Complete Workspace puts the whole tree back from whatever pack a checkout does have.
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]rena[Ww]orkspace/
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]rena[Ww]orkspace.meta

# Generated maps: a map is a seed, some parameters and a list of edits, and the prefab and the
# JSON here are both exports of one.
/[Aa]ssets/[Mm]aps/
/[Aa]ssets/[Mm]aps.meta

# The package's own sample, copied in by the Package Manager from Samples~. The copy is not the
# source; Window → Package Manager → ArenaForge → Samples writes it again.
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]amples/
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]amples.meta
